{"id":"9718c3e2-1f81-41cf-ab6e-955454f88999","kind":"note","ref":{"span":"c57fa82b9af4cfbe","key":"bablr1","file":"packages/editor/build/vite.ts","baseline":{"blob":"5ae4206a08b95532c74b11063b0675fa66401600","start":5811,"end":5874},"shape":{"type":"CallExpression","atoms":["res",".","setHeader","(","\"","Cross-Origin-Embedder-Policy","\"",",","\"","credentialless","\"",")"]},"context":{"before":"d72859297b372d37","after":"f2652ba7e399eabc"}},"payload":{"text":"The workbench needs SharedArrayBuffer, so this iframe's document must be\ncross-origin isolated too — it inherits isolation from the (isolated) host page\nonly if its own responses carry COEP. Match the host's `credentialless` mode.","wrote":["Brian Jenkins"]},"author":"local","createdAt":"2026-11-22T17:10:35.987Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-22T17:10:35.987Z"}
{"id":"9a4eb74c-df5d-4868-bc79-5fc239d06ea8","kind":"note","ref":{"span":"9ffee7089d81733a","key":"bablr1","file":"packages/editor/build/vite.ts","baseline":{"blob":"4ec92179c1b0cb1ed6f0d122607e9ca5e5c2c0ce","start":4025,"end":4145},"shape":{"type":"ObjectElement","atoms":["\"","attrs","\"",":","{","\"","rel","\"",":","\"","preload","\"",",","\"","as","\"",":","\"","script","\"",",","\"","crossorigin","\"",":","\"","","\"",",","\"","fetchpriority","\"",":","\"","low","\"",",","\"","href","\"",":","MOUNT",".","slice","(","1",")","+","file","}",","]},"context":{"before":"ac343fae5b73bad8","after":"0e2870a783d54e7f"}},"payload":{"text":"Low priority: on a warm load these are ~14MB of cache reads that would otherwise delay the shell's own files.","wrote":["Brian Jenkins"]},"author":"local","createdAt":"2026-11-22T17:10:38.382Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-22T17:10:38.382Z"}
{"id":"9bba61f1-2cc9-4007-86ee-a77b4d30a6f5","kind":"note","ref":{"span":"9fdd727b01634675","key":"bablr1","file":"packages/editor/build/vite.ts","baseline":{"blob":"d56fe0748907d80de4b0eb1728618f46d01818c1","start":1111,"end":1681},"shape":{"type":"FunctionDeclaration","atoms":["function","componentStaticChunks","(","componentDist",":","string",")",":","string","[]","{","const","seen","=","new","Set","<","string",">","(",")",";","const","pending","=","[","\"","main.js","\"","]",";","while","(","pending",".","length",">","0",")","{","const","file","=","pending",".","pop","(",")",";","if","(","!","seen",".","has","(","file",")","&&","fs",".","existsSync","(","path",".","join","(","componentDist",",","file",")",")",")","{","seen",".","add","(","file",")",";","for","(","const","match","of","fs",".","readFileSync","(","path",".","join","(","componentDist",",","file",")",")",".","matchAll","(","/","(?:^|[;}\\s])(?:import|export)(?:[\\w${}*,\\s]+from\\s*|\\s*)[\"'](\\.\\/[^\"']+\\.js)[\"']","/","gu",")",")","{","pending",".","push","(","path",".","posix",".","normalize","(","match","[","1","]",")",")",";","}","}","}","seen",".","delete","(","\"","main.js","\"",")",";","return","[","...","seen","]",".","sort","(",")",";","}"]},"context":{"before":"65b2b17c604f9f9b","after":"69879ecbcd6c728b"}},"payload":{"text":"Minimal iframe host page: the grid/layout lives in the <Workbench/> component (stitches), so this\njust resets the document and loads the workbench entry bundle.","wrote":["Brian Jenkins"]},"author":"local","createdAt":"2026-11-22T17:10:43.155Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-22T17:10:43.155Z"}
{"id":"a0f79e2b-060a-493c-9775-52bc8f2bbbe8","kind":"note","ref":{"span":"0afe5a9cf843dbae","key":"bablr1","file":"packages/editor/build/vite.ts","baseline":{"blob":"9ea2a93c149d4928a91f31a7b5eac4c10bcb40f8","start":6862,"end":7384},"shape":{"type":"For","atoms":["for","(","const","root","of","roots",")","{","await","find","(","root",")",".","type","(","\"","f","\"",")",".","exec","(","async","(","absolute",")","=>","{","const","relative","=","path",".","relative","(","root",",","absolute",")",".","split","(","path",".","sep",")",".","join","(","\"","/","\"",")",";","if","(","emitted",".","has","(","relative",")",")","{","return",";","}","emitted",".","add","(","relative",")",";","this",".","emitFile","(","{","\"","type","\"",":","\"","asset","\"",",","\"","fileName","\"",":","path",".","posix",".","join","(","\"","__vscode__","\"",",","relative",")",",","\"","source","\"",":","await","fs",".","readFile","(","absolute",",","{","\"","encoding","\"",":","null","}",")","}",")",";","}",")",";","}"]},"context":{"before":"13097c2f2c7fac8b"}},"payload":{"text":"Roots stay sequential so the dedupe below sees the workbench entry before the component; within one root paths are unique.","wrote":["Brian Jenkins"]},"author":"local","createdAt":"2026-11-22T17:10:34.742Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-22T17:10:34.742Z"}
{"id":"b443c100-feb8-496d-a9fa-1082629418ea","kind":"note","ref":{"span":"6e6a075e13306db4","key":"bablr1","file":"packages/editor/build/vite.ts","baseline":{"blob":"7ad4e40a3641b85a2c808975ee3646fe95bb2330","start":0,"end":34},"shape":{"type":"ImportDeclaration","atoms":["import","type","{","Plugin","}","from","\"","vite","\""]},"context":{"after":"bca5244780e81d0e"}},"payload":{"text":"Serves the VS Code workbench for the iframe in `vscode.tsx`.\n\nThe iframe loads `<base>/__vscode__/host.html`, a minimal page that pulls in the composed entry\n`workbench.js` (built from workbench-entry.tsx into this package's `dist/` by entry.config.ts),\nwhich renders <Workbench/> and boots the monaco component's `main.js`. So `/__vscode__/` is served\nfrom two roots: this package's `dist/` (host entry) and the LOCAL monaco-vscode-api component's\n`dist/` (main.js + chunks + worker/wasm/font assets + monaco's own webview index.html). The host\napp supplies cross-origin isolation (SharedArrayBuffer); this plugin only serves files (with COEP so\nthe iframe inherits it).\n\nThe monaco dist is resolved by RELATIVE PATH to editor's own `components/monaco-vscode-api/dist`\n(not the published lib tarball) — editor owns that component now.","wrote":["Brian Jenkins"]},"author":"local","createdAt":"2026-11-22T17:10:44.295Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-22T17:10:44.295Z"}
{"id":"1a7c9ff0-40e3-4d47-8a0a-53fd2a9a0df9","kind":"note","ref":{"span":"fd0392931d9ce71c","key":"bablr1","file":"packages/editor/build/vite.ts","baseline":{"blob":"4905f219d74378997729bc64474e23faa6164700","start":3611,"end":3643},"shape":{"type":"VariableDeclaration","atoms":["const","index","=","url",".","indexOf","(","MOUNT",")"]},"context":{"before":"786e4aaa7612eb3b","after":"c6fc00a30151cdd9"}},"payload":{"text":"tolerate any base prefix (e.g. /editor/)","wrote":["Brian Jenkins"]},"author":"local","createdAt":"2026-11-22T19:04:12.679Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-22T19:04:12.679Z"}
{"id":"7145035f-1a9a-4e30-ad6a-e166f499c347","kind":"note","ref":{"span":"02320028df95c1a1#10","key":"bablr1","file":"packages/editor/build/vite.ts","baseline":{"blob":"96c4b24324f1d7b0095391cfdd5253806e1f54a7","start":4812,"end":4818},"shape":{"type":"Keyword","atoms":["return"]},"context":{"before":"aa589d446c34d9c7","after":"907e2337892b3259"}},"payload":{"text":"workbench entry wins over component on conflict","wrote":["Brian Jenkins"]},"author":"local","createdAt":"2026-11-22T19:04:10.131Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-22T19:04:10.131Z"}
